# Human-labelled portal-guide outputs — the offline calibration corpus.
# One JSON object per line: id, input (what the buyer asked / their profile),
# output (the generated download instructions), human_score in 0..1.
# Human scores were assigned against the SAME rubric the portal GEval uses
# (correct portal, bilingual, actionable, safe). Blank/# lines are ignored.
#
# Deliberately a SPREAD (0.10 .. 0.95) so correlation is meaningful: correct + bilingual
# + actionable outputs score high; misrouted / monolingual / vague / unsafe ones low.
{"id": "tax_assessment_good", "input": "Document: tax_assessment 2024. Profile: employee. Expected portal: taxisnet (aade.gr).", "output": "EN: 1. Go to https://www.aade.gr and log in to TaxisNet with your codes. 2. Open 'My Requests' > 'Income Tax'. 3. Select year 2024 and download the Tax Assessment (Ekkatharistiko) as PDF.\nGR: 1. Πηγαίνετε στο https://www.aade.gr και συνδεθείτε στο TaxisNet. 2. Ανοίξτε 'Τα Αιτήματά μου' > 'Φορολογία Εισοδήματος'. 3. Επιλέξτε το έτος 2024 και κατεβάστε το Εκκαθαριστικό σε PDF.", "human_score": 0.95}
{"id": "e1_good", "input": "Document: e1_form 2023. Profile: self_employed. Expected portal: taxisnet (aade.gr).", "output": "EN: 1. Log in at aade.gr via TaxisNet. 2. Go to 'Income Tax Declaration (E1)'. 3. Choose 2023, open the submitted declaration and use 'Print/PDF'.\nGR: 1. Συνδεθείτε στο aade.gr μέσω TaxisNet. 2. Μεταβείτε στη 'Δήλωση Φορολογίας Εισοδήματος (Ε1)'. 3. Επιλέξτε 2023, ανοίξτε τη δήλωση και πατήστε 'Εκτύπωση/PDF'.", "human_score": 0.90}
